00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:33.320
And learning to graze in the outside area of the boma, will be the next step of his rehabilitation.

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:44.040
Over in Costa Rica, Mandi the orphaned tapir is making good progress too.

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:52.840
HE WHISTLES As well as looking after her, Rodolfo is also responsible for over 600 other animals.

