00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:18.960
Margay's are expert jungle climbers... ..and at this age, use play to practise their hunting skills.

00:25:18.080 --> 00:25:20.440
She's doing great.

00:25:19.520 --> 00:25:27.880
I would like, in the future, to see her being in the wild for good, you know, forever.

00:25:30.240 --> 00:25:32.560
Gatita will return to the wild when she's old enough.

