You know.

00:27:26.520 --> 00:27:31.720
And then she's just looking...begging for...for a mum, that's a normal behaviour.

00:27:31.080 --> 00:27:33.520
This is a set-back for Mandi.

00:27:32.720 --> 00:27:38.280
And for now, she's going back to the safety of her own enclosure.

00:27:37.720 --> 00:27:38.760
Mandi.

00:27:39.200 --> 00:27:48.480
It's really quite heartbreaking to know that Mandi is so close to getting the attention she needs, but if Mandi's going to be accepted, then she needs to start acting like a tapir.

00:27:50.200 --> 00:27:54.240
But lucky enough her, she has Rodolfo to give her a head start.

