And that is going to be his next challenge.

00:28:49.320 --> 00:29:03.160
White rhinos have a square mouth with wide, prehensile lips that can grab, enabling them to graze and eat grass more efficiently than a lawnmower.

00:29:03.120 --> 00:29:11.200
Until now, Manji's only eaten prepared, cut grass and has never had the opportunity to find his own food.

00:29:14.360 --> 00:29:19.920
With moral support from his herd, he's going to venture into the outside area of the boma.

