And it's a key part of Petronel's strategy.

00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:29.160
I've learned through years of experience - give them their space and give them time, don't try and rush them.

00:29:28.240 --> 00:29:33.880
Don't try and let them do the things you want them to do.

00:29:33.280 --> 00:29:36.720
We don't want prisoners, we want wild animals.

