Rhinos are incredibly sensitive and Petronel isn't sure how Manji will react.

00:29:45.000 --> 00:29:49.080
Another big day for Manji.

00:29:48.240 --> 00:29:56.600
Now he's going to come out and really smell and see natural-growing veld and grass for the first time.

00:29:55.960 --> 00:30:04.800
And his natural instinct will come out of grazing and he will definitely follow Venus' lead.

00:30:03.840 --> 00:30:05.560
So, let's see what they do.

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:07.800
Hello.

