But Manji doesn't remember a world outside of an enclosure and lets Venus and Mia take the first steps.

00:30:18.680 --> 00:30:19.920
There we go.

00:30:19.640 --> 00:30:21.680
There we go.

00:30:20.960 --> 00:30:24.800
Kom, kom.

00:30:24.720 --> 00:30:28.600
SHE GASPS It's OK, it's OK.

