This is the largest open space they've been in since they lost their mothers and their natural instincts kick in.

00:30:39.320 --> 00:30:41.080
Bit too much for Venus, you can see that clearly.

00:30:40.240 --> 00:30:41.440
A big step.

00:30:40.480 --> 00:30:41.600
Going back to their safe place.

00:30:40.640 --> 00:30:47.240
It's overwhelming and they all head back inside.

00:30:46.440 --> 00:30:55.160
It's wonderful, but also a little bit of our first day at school type of situation.

00:30:54.200 --> 00:30:55.240
But with encouragement, they give it another go.

00:30:54.280 --> 00:30:55.640
There we go.

00:30:54.680 --> 00:30:55.840
Kom, kom, kom.

