At two months old, a rhino calf will start to graze on a range of vegetation, and Petronel knows how important this milestone is.

00:32:46.040 --> 00:32:53.200
I want them so badly out here and grazing, and it's a privilege for me to see this today, and just to be part of the herd.

00:32:52.360 --> 00:32:58.200
And them coming and going and being free - it's just the best day ever.

00:32:58.560 --> 00:33:11.440
Manji is on course with his rehabilitation, and if all goes to plan, his next step will be freedom into the wild reserve.

00:33:12.520 --> 00:33:27.840
In Costa Rica, Mandi the tapir is also about to learn survival skills.

00:33:27.400 --> 00:33:29.000
Hey, Mandi.

00:33:28.040 --> 00:33:31.320
Drink.

00:33:30.400 --> 00:33:38.880
To bring her closer to tapirs Bribri and Bubu, Rodolfo wants Mandi to develop more of the jungle traits essential to being a tapir.

