In the wild, tapirs will spend up to two years with their mothers.

00:33:45.480 --> 00:33:54.360
And you can see that little Bubu is watching his mother Bribri very carefully, everything that she does.

00:33:53.440 --> 00:33:57.000
And he can see that she's eating these bananas, and...

00:33:56.200 --> 00:33:57.760
There you go.

