He's watched her, he's seen that it's safe to eat, and he's copied her, and this is something that Mandi's missing out on.

00:34:06.680 --> 00:34:10.840
Without her own kind to be with...

00:34:13.360 --> 00:34:22.360
..Rodolfo has assumed the role of surrogate mum and is taking Mandi on a walk with a purpose.

00:34:21.400 --> 00:34:27.280
Today I am taking Mandi to the forest, giving her the opportunity to learn.

